<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-392] Test cases for logGamma, Distribution.normal and Distribution.beta, fix for Distribution.normal</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-392</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>
&lt;p&gt;I need access to the normal distribution to write test cases for random matrices.  While testing that, I found it wasn&apos;t quite right so I provided an alternative implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12464045">MAHOUT-392</key>
            <summary>Test cases for logGamma, Distribution.normal and Distribution.beta, fix for Distribution.normal</summary>
